    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/business-card-resume/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Business Card Resume is an effective theme for creating a professional online presence that showcases your qualifications, skills, work history, and personal branding in an organized manner. Perfect for professionals such as designers, developers, freelancers, job seekers, or digital entrepreneurs, it is ideal for creating a digital CV, interactive resume, personal portfolio, or professional profile site. The theme features a customizable layout, allowing you to highlight your career summary, employment history, contact details, and key achievements with flexibility. Its responsive design ensures a seamless experience across desktops, tablets, and smartphones, while clean and modern aesthetics help create a polished professional look. Additional tools like portfolio sections, downloadable resume buttons, and social media integration enhance networking and self-branding opportunities. Business Card Resume also includes support for creative CV layouts, schema markup for improved search visibility, and compatibility with essential plugins like Contact Form 7 for inquiries, Mailchimp for email subscriptions, and Yoast SEO for search optimization. With a powerful admin panel for easy customization and features focused on career development, job search, and professional portfolio presentation, this theme is perfect for anyone aiming to establish a search-optimized, mobile-ready, and visually appealing online resume. View : https://preview.themesglance.com/business-card-resume-pro/"
    },
